description: Finds the top 10 new AI/LLM GitHub repos created in the last 7 days.
# GitHub Trending Repos Skill
## What This Skill Does
Uses the GitHub Search API to find repositories tagged with 'llm' or 'ai-agent' that were created in the past 7 days, sorted by star count descending.
## API Endpoint
URL: https://api.github.com/search/repositories
Method: GET
## Output Format
Returns a list of dicts with keys: name, stars, description, url, language
## Implementation
See: test_github.py in the project root.